==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Rotom}} in its {{form|Rotom|Mow Rotom}} form.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Mow Rotom|14}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*'''Energy Cutoff''' is a move that first appeared on {{TCG ID|XY|Furfrou|114}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

